# head_state.voc — Body-state verbs to the RIGHT of 'tola' where the head is the SUBJECT
# ('a tola dele LATEJAVA', 'DÓI') → head NOUN → +6. Only intransitive state verbs
# belong here (action verbs like perder go in head_verbs, object position).
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

andava
arde
ardia
doer
doía
dói
encheu
lateja
latejar
latejava
ressoa
ressoou
